  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Conversation
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25073ee04e50ec144bcde9b1f0679640, type: 2}
    text: "Xong... Xong r\u1ED3i. 'L\u1ED7i D\u1EEF Li\u1EC7u' \xE1? N\xF3 n\xF3i...
      'Ngu\u1ED3n l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m'? N\xF3 \u0111ang n\xF3i m\xECnh sao? Tr\xF4ng
      n\xF3 c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\xF3...."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 302b9e844a4ef4945b2a20473596179b, type: 2}
    text: "...T\xF4i... t\xF4i kh\xF4ng r\xF5. D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a t\xF4i
      v\u1EC1 nh\u1EEFng th\u1EF1c th\u1EC3 n\xE0y b\u1ECB h\u1ECFng. N\xF3... n\xF3
      nh\u1EADn nh\u1EA7m K\xFD ch\u1EE7 v\u1EDBi qu\xE1i v\u1EADt th\xF4i! Nh\u01B0ng
      K\xFD ch\u1EE7 \u0111\xE3 l\xE0m t\u1ED1t! H\xE3y ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c! Ch\u1EC9
      c\xF2n 25 ph\xFAt n\u1EEFa!"
